silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_01_forge_engineer_entry_point_concrete_anchor_0 silm:hasExample "In 'S01ForgeEngineerEntryPointConcreteAnchor0', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the physical individual Mittens: microchip 985112345678901, vet-clinic file F11-2026, body mass 4.2 kg, domestic cat (Felis catus, TSN 183798). This is the FORGE OUTPUT: both the direct stamp (path c) and the two-stage quality-controlled route (path r circ a) produce the same microchip-certified individual.." .
